  <section class="container policy"><p class="policy-date">Last updated September 2026</p><h2>Product information</h2><p>Each piece is handmade in a small batch. Minor variations in color, texture, and construction are part of handmade production. Product pages provide the most current materials, sizing, and availability.</p><h2>Pricing and availability</h2><p>Prices and availability may change before an order is placed. An item added to a cart is not reserved until checkout is complete.</p><h2>Review before ordering</h2><p>Customers are responsible for reviewing all product details before ordering, including measurements when provided, listed dimensions, materials, color, care, and intended use. Please contact the studio with questions before purchase.</p><h2>Final sale</h2><p>All sales are final. Good Apollo Goods does not offer returns, exchanges, repairs, or refunds.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@goodapollogoods.com">hello@goodapollogoods.com</a> with questions about these terms.</p></section>
</Layout>
